https://www.facebook.com/groups/535191898389252/,"Midnight Takeover (Lincoln, Lincolnshire)",Private · 2.1K members,"{""raw_text"": ""Midnight Takeover (Lincoln, Lincolnshire)\nPrivate group\n\u00b7\n2.2K members\nJoin Group\nShare\nAbout\nDiscussion\nMore\nAbout\nDiscussion\nMidnight Takeover (Lincoln, Lincolnshire)\nJoin Group\nShare\nAbout this group\nhi, I am a car lover and have a passion for motors.  This is a group that I am making to get away from the people side of things and re-focus ba\n\u2026\nSee more\nPrivate\nOnly members can see who's in the group and what they post.\nVisible\nAnyone can find this group.\nHistory\nGroup created on 6 July 2022. Name last changed on 25 September 2025.\nSee more\nTags\nMotorsports \u2022 Cars\nLincoln, Lincolnshire\nMembers\n\u00b7\n2.2K\nBejay\nand\nAndy\nare admins.\nThere are Pages in this group. Pages may be managed by multiple people who can see all group members and content.\nLearn more\nActivity\nNo posts today\n6 in the last month\n2,180 total members\nNo new members in the last week\nCreated on\n4 years ago\nGroup rules from the admins\n1\nBe respectful.\nBullying will not be tolerated. This includes hostile attitudes towards or concerning; race, political standings, sexual orientation, gender, culture, religion, identity,  disabilities, or any other protected qualities. We want everyone to have a good time here, and that doesn\u2019t include making others feel uncomfortable.\nIf you feel someone may be taking it too far, please contact an admin or moderator to discuss the situation rather than continuing it on the group page.\n2\nNo spamming.\nThis is pretty self explanatory. No spamming posts, comments, etc. This includes posts that we suspect may be to gain personal information on members such as their first pet\u2019s names, or to send them to an external link that may contain malware. Suspected bot accounts will be banned immediately for damage control.\n3\nSharing of other car groups or events.\nIf you are an admin/ moderator of another group and you wish to share a group or event, please either contact an admin or moderator prior to submitting a post for approval.\nThere are some groups or events we will automatically decline for the safety of our members. These typically are non static events or underground events. If we suspect that an event or group may be one of these, we reserve the right to remove the post if it has been pre-approved. Promotions work on an exchange basis.\n4\nSelling.\nWe understand that sometimes you move on from your previous love and need to sell. We don\u2019t mind you posting your pre-loved cars or parts here. All that we ask is that the ad is honest and not a scam.\nHostile Takeover is not associated nor responsible for any repercussions of vehicles advertised on the group page. It is purely the seller\u2019s responsibility for any and all sales related issues.\n5\nSponsors and businesses.\nWe welcome sponsors. As well as having their business pinned at the top of the group, sponsors and businesses will have a chance to promote their businesses on \u201cSponsor Sunday\u201d. \u201cSponsor Sunday\u201d is every first Sunday of the month, and gives sponsors and businesses the chance to make a post showing what products or services they have to offer to Hostile Takeover members.\nSponsors and businesses must provide a discount for Hostile Takeover members, and this must be mentioned in the posts.\n6\nEvent decorum.\nWhilst representing Hostile Takeover at events, we expect members to act within the law. Whilst we may not all agree with every law, they are there for a reason, and it is important that we keep ourselves and others safe.\nOur events are strictly static. That means keys out unless you are entering, exiting or are asked to relocate. Any members found to be disrespecting the venue with wheel spins, donuts, loud revving, etc will be asked to leave and removed from the group."", ""sections"": {""Midnight Takeover (Lincoln, Lincolns